#: package/analyses/condLogReg.description
#: condLogReg/options.description.main
msgid ""
"Conditional logistic regression for matched case-control data: the model is "
"fitted by the conditional likelihood within the matched sets, as a Cox model "
"stratified by matched set (the same fit as survival::clogit)."
msgstr "Regressió logística condicional per a dades de casos i controls aparellats: el model s'ajusta per la versemblança condicional dins dels conjunts aparellats, com un model de Cox estratificat per conjunt (el mateix ajust que survival::clogit)."

#: package.description
msgid ""
"Conditional logistic regression for matched case-control studies: a clone of "
"jmv's Binomial Logistic Regression with a matching variable, fitted by the "
"conditional likelihood (Cox model stratified by matched set, as "
"survival::clogit)."
msgstr "Regressió logística condicional per a estudis de casos i controls aparellats: un clon de la regressió logística binomial de jmv amb una variable d'aparellament, ajustada per la versemblança condicional (model de Cox estratificat per conjunt, com survival::clogit)."

